    "Display P3 keeps the camera's colors. sRGB suits sites and screens that show only sRGB; colors outside it are clipped.": {
      "comment": "Explains the color space picker. Display P3 and sRGB are color space names; keep them unchanged.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Display P3 behält die Farben der Kamera. sRGB eignet sich für Websites und Bildschirme, die nur sRGB anzeigen; Farben außerhalb davon werden beschnitten."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Display P3 conserva los colores de la cámara. sRGB es adecuado para sitios y pantallas que solo muestran sRGB; los colores fuera de él se recortan."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Display P3 conserve les couleurs de l’appareil photo. sRGB convient aux sites et écrans qui n’affichent que le sRGB ; les couleurs hors de cet espace sont écrêtées."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Display P3 mantiene i colori della fotocamera. sRGB è adatto a siti e schermi che mostrano solo sRGB; i colori al di fuori vengono tagliati."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Display P3はカメラの色を保ちます。sRGBはsRGBしか表示できないサイトや画面に適しています。範囲外の色はクリップされます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Display P3는 카메라의 색상을 유지합니다. sRGB는 sRGB만 표시하는 사이트와 화면에 적합하며, 범위를 벗어난 색상은 잘립니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Display P3 behoudt de kleuren van de camera. sRGB past bij sites en schermen die alleen sRGB tonen; kleuren daarbuiten worden afgekapt."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Display P3 mantém as cores da câmera. sRGB é adequado para sites e telas que mostram apenas sRGB; as cores fora dele são cortadas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Display P3 保留相机的色彩。sRGB 适合只显示 sRGB 的网站和屏幕；超出范围的颜色会被裁切。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Display P3 保留相機的色彩。sRGB 適合只顯示 sRGB 的網站和螢幕；超出範圍的顏色會被裁切。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
